{
  "code": "newton_rings",
  "name": "牛顿环法测定平凸透镜曲率半径",
  "enabled": true,
  "category": "optics",
  "dataCollection": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "menuLabels": [
    "仪器摆放与光路装调",
    "目镜视度调节与粗调成像",
    "暗环直径测量",
    "曲率半径计算",
    "实验结束整理"
  ],
  "steps": {
    "1": {
      "title": "仪器摆放与光路装调",
      "correctionMode": "vision",
      "assistMock": {
        "errorType": "光路装调",
        "detail": "牛顿环中心未放到物镜下方、底座反光镜未收起或 45° 半反镜未对准，容易造成视场杂散光和条纹亮度不均。",
        "feedback": "**原因分析**：牛顿环需要钠光经 45° 半反镜近似垂直照射空气膜；底部杂散光会降低干涉条纹对比度。\n\n**纠错指导**：\n1. **编号1**：确认牛顿环组件位于物镜正下方并已用压片压稳。\n2. **编号2**：将底座反光镜向内收起，微调半反镜使视场亮度均匀。",
        "marks": [
          { "x": 268, "y": 182, "w": 124, "h": 104, "n": 1 },
          { "x": 518, "y": 252, "w": 110, "h": 92, "n": 2 }
        ]
      },
      "guidePath": "steps/1.md"
    },
    "2": {
      "title": "目镜视度调节与粗调成像",
      "correctionMode": "vision",
      "dataFields": [
        {
          "key": "focus_lift_position_mm",
          "label": "调焦升降位置",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 60,
          "required": false,
          "placeholder": "环纹清晰时的升降尺读数",
          "photoAssist": true,
          "scaleReading": true,
          "scaleAxis": "vertical",
          "scaleDirection": "down",
          "scaleUnitPerTick": 1,
          "scaleZeroValue": 0
        },
        {
          "key": "stage_lateral_position_mm",
          "label": "横向居中位置",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 60,
          "required": false,
          "placeholder": "中心暗斑居中时的横移尺读数",
          "photoAssist": true,
          "scaleReading": true,
          "scaleAxis": "horizontal",
          "scaleDirection": "left",
          "scaleUnitPerTick": 1,
          "scaleZeroValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "assistMock": {
        "errorType": "调焦成像",
        "detail": "十字分划板未先调清，或调焦方向错误，导致环纹不清晰并存在撞击玻璃风险。",
        "feedback": "**原因分析**：读数显微镜应先调清叉丝，再让镜筒由低处向高处抬升寻找牛顿环。\n\n**纠错指导**：\n1. **编号1**：旋节目镜使十字丝清晰。\n2. **编号2**：缓慢上升镜筒并微调半反镜，直到中心暗斑和同心圆环清楚。",
        "marks": [
          { "x": 302, "y": 168, "w": 118, "h": 100, "n": 1 },
          { "x": 548, "y": 278, "w": 104, "h": 88, "n": 2 }
        ]
      },
      "guidePath": "steps/2.md"
    },
    "3": {
      "title": "暗环直径测量",
      "correctionMode": "data",
      "dataSource": "image",
      "deviceType": "reading_microscope",
      "dataFields": [
        { "key": "ring_m", "label": "暗环级数 m", "type": "number", "required": true, "placeholder": "如 10" },
        { "key": "ring_n", "label": "暗环级数 n", "type": "number", "required": false, "placeholder": "如 15" },
        { "key": "reading_left_mm", "label": "左侧读数", "type": "number", "unit": "mm", "min": 0, "max": 100, "required": true },
        { "key": "reading_right_mm", "label": "右侧读数", "type": "number", "unit": "mm", "min": 0, "max": 100, "required": true },
        { "key": "diameter_D_mm", "label": "暗环直径 D", "type": "number", "unit": "mm", "min": 0, "max": 50, "required": false, "computed": "abs(reading_right_mm - reading_left_mm)" }
      ],
      "assistMock": {
        "errorType": "暗环读数",
        "detail": "叉丝未与暗环相切、测量方向不是直径方向，或测微鼓轮中途反转。",
        "feedback": "**原因分析**：弦长会小于直径，空程差会让左右读数不可比。\n\n**纠错指导**：\n1. **编号1**：让竖叉丝与暗环外侧相切，并沿圆环直径方向移动。\n2. **编号2**：全程保持同一转向，按左侧 m 到 n、右侧 n 到 m 的顺序记录。",
        "marks": [
          { "x": 276, "y": 194, "w": 122, "h": 106, "n": 1 },
          { "x": 532, "y": 264, "w": 108, "h": 90, "n": 2 }
        ]
      },
      "guidePath": "steps/3.md"
    },
    "4": {
      "title": "曲率半径计算",
      "correctionMode": "data",
      "dataSource": "image",
      "dataFields": [
        { "key": "delta_m", "label": "环序差 |m-n|", "type": "number", "min": 1, "required": true, "placeholder": "建议 ≥ 5" },
        { "key": "delta_D2_mm2", "label": "Dₘ²-Dₙ²", "type": "number", "unit": "mm²", "min": 0, "required": true },
        { "key": "lambda_nm", "label": "钠黄光波长 λ", "type": "number", "unit": "nm", "min": 400, "max": 700, "required": false, "placeholder": "589.3" },
        { "key": "radius_R_mm", "label": "曲率半径 R", "type": "number", "unit": "mm", "min": 100, "max": 10000, "required": false },
        { "key": "average_R_mm", "label": "平均曲率半径", "type": "number", "unit": "mm", "min": 100, "max": 10000, "required": false }
      ],
      "assistMock": {
        "errorType": "公式与单位",
        "detail": "公式中漏掉 4、把 nm/mm/m 混用，或环序差小于 5 导致结果波动大。",
        "feedback": "**原因分析**：R = (Dₘ² - Dₙ²) / [4(m - n)λ]，代入时必须统一单位。\n\n**纠错指导**：\n1. **编号1**：若 D 用 mm，λ 也要换成 mm 再计算 R。\n2. **编号2**：优先使用 |m-n| ≥ 5 的数据组并求平均。",
        "marks": [
          { "x": 288, "y": 176, "w": 120, "h": 102, "n": 1 },
          { "x": 556, "y": 286, "w": 102, "h": 86, "n": 2 }
        ]
      },
      "guidePath": "steps/4.md"
    },
    "5": {
      "title": "实验结束整理",
      "correctionMode": "vision",
      "assistMock": {
        "errorType": "收纳复原",
        "detail": "光源、CCD 或监视器未关闭，光学器件未盖好，线缆和附件未恢复原位。",
        "feedback": "**原因分析**：光学实验结束后的清洁与复原会影响下一组观察质量。\n\n**纠错指导**：\n1. **编号1**：关闭钠光灯、监视器与 CCD 电源。\n2. **编号2**：取下牛顿环器件，盖好镜头盖并整理线缆。",
        "marks": [
          { "x": 300, "y": 180, "w": 118, "h": 100, "n": 1 },
          { "x": 540, "y": 260, "w": 110, "h": 90, "n": 2 }
        ]
      },
      "guidePath": "steps/5.md"
    }
  },
  "simulation": {
    "url": "/newton-rings-simulation/index.html",
    "required": true,
    "title": "牛顿环虚拟仿真预习"
  },
  "reportGuidePath": "report-guide.md"
}
